    "body": "Yes , \r\ntheir is no problem in using \"Aside\" inside the main directly .\r\nBut Now it is better to use it inside the section tag.\r\nLike :\r\n\r\n```\r\n<main>\r\n  <section>\r\n     <aside>More on this story</aside>\r\n  </section>\r\n</main>\r\n```\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/75080333/130665725-d6ec5a54-9655-416d-8fd2-25e61f50fa90.png)\r\n\r\n\r\nIf this is not your issue then please explain me your issue again with little more discription\r\n",
