    "body": "> Yes ,\r\n> their is no problem in using \"Aside\" inside the main directly .\r\n> But Now it is better to use it inside the section tag.\r\n\r\nThanks for your response, but I'm a bit confused by what you mean. I noticed you've pasted my crude example into the MDN HTML Demo tool, but I'm not sure what that shows us other than how MDN chooses to visually render it. 🙂 Also, I'm not sure why you're suggesting the example should use `section` instead of `article`. This is a question about what HTML semantics are appropriate for screen readers.\r\n\r\nI've updated the title of the issue so that it's no longer phrased as a question. I hope that helps resolve any confusion.",
